  "view": "Info Edge's Q2 billings grew 12.8% to INR 8.22 billion, with recruitment up 12.6% and 99acres up 21.2%. Management and analysts say underlying recruitment growth was 14-15% after adjusting for renewal timing delays. 20 of 22 analysts rate it Buy. The stock jumped 4.4% on the update.",
