  "view": "Info Edge billings grew 12.8% in Q2, but that's slower than Q1's 14.4%. Recruitment, the core business, rose 12.6%, while Shiksha fell 27.2%. The Naukri mental health survey is a brand signal, not a financial one. Mixed flow, no clear direction.",
